, "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Hatib je svoj govor popratio dovom.", "en": "The preacher followed up his speech with an invocation.", "bn": "খতিব তার বক্তব্যের পর দু'আর মাধ্যমে কথা শেষ করেছেন।", "fa": "خطیب سخنانش را با دعا دنبال کرد.", "fr": "Le prédicateur a fait suivre son discours d'une invocation.", "id": "Khatib itu menyusuli pidatonya dengan doa.", "tr": "Hatip konuşmasını bir duayla sürdürdü.", "ur": "خطیب نے اپنی تقریر کا اختتام دعا سے کیا۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "قَفَّى", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "popratio je", "en": "followed up", "bn": "অনুসরণ করেছে", "fa": "پی گرفت", "fr": "a fait suivre", "id": "dia menyusuli", "tr": "devam ettirdi", "ur": "پیروی کی"}}, {"arabic": "الْخَطِيبُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "hatib", "en": "the preacher", "bn": "খতিব", "fa": "خطیب", "fr": "le prédicateur", "id": "khatib itu", "tr": "hatip", "ur": "خطیب"}}, {"arabic": "عَلَى", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "na", "en": "on", "bn": "উপর", "fa": "بر", "fr": "sur", "id": "di atas", "tr": "üzerinde", "ur": "پر"}}, {"arabic": "كَلَامِهِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "svoj govor", "en": "his speech", "bn": "তার কথার", "fa": "سخنانش", "fr": "son discours", "id": "pidatonya", "tr": "konuşması", "ur": "اس کی تقریر"}}, {"arabic": "بِدُعَاءٍ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "dovom", "en": "with an invocation", "bn": "দু'আর সাথে", "fa": "با دعا", "fr": "d'une invocation", "id": "dengan doa", "tr": "duayla", "ur": "دعا کے ساتھ"}}]}, {"arabic": "يُقَفِّي الْمُعَلِّمُ عَلَى الدَّرْسِ بِتَمَارِينَ", "spoken": "audio/ac564bea548278e8f7f0.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Učitelj lekciju prati vježbama.", "en": "The teacher follows up the lesson with exercises.", "bn": "শিক্ষক পাঠের পর অনুশীলনী দিয়ে পাঠটিকে সম্পূর্ণ করেন।", "fa": "معلم درس را با تمرین‌ها پی می‌گیرد.", "fr": "Le professeur fait suivre la leçon d'exercices.", "id": "Guru itu menyusuli pelajaran de